=Generate a FULL 4-TOUCH outbound email sequence for this veterinary lead. Each touch uses a DIFFERENT angle — never repeat.

LEAD INFO:
DM Name: {{ $json.dmName }}
Lead Name: {{ $json.firstName }} {{ $json.lastName }}
Title: {{ $json.title }}
Company: {{ $json.company }}
Email: {{ $json.email }}
Location: {{ $json.city }}, {{ $json.state }}
Website: {{ $json.website }}
ICP Rating: {{ $json.icpRating }}
Product Fit: {{ $json.product }}

ENRICHMENT DATA:
{{ $json.description }}

LINKEDIN & WEB INTEL:
{{ $json.linkedinProfile }}

=== PRODUCT KNOWLEDGE ===

NEW LUMEN: PACS takes 30+ sec to load = 45 min/day wasted. Callbacks from bad positioning cost $50-200. Referring vets burn CDs or fight VPN. DICOM errors corrupt archives. NEW LUMEN: web viewer opens in 2 sec, AI Quality Check cuts callbacks 60%, one-click teleconsult URLs, auto DICOM validation, cloud-native no servers. ROI: $15-30K/year saved.

STABLETRACK AI: No signal at farms = no patient history. Paper notes then 30 min typing. 3 owners 5 horses 1 bill = nightmare. Missing follow-ups. STABLETRACK: voice-to-text hands-free, full offline mode, smart split billing, equine fields (markings/Coggins/farrier), route optimization. ROI: 8-12 hrs/week saved.

=== 4-TOUCH GUIDE ===

TOUCH 1 DAY 1 THE HOOK: Open with specific LinkedIn/website reference. Hit #1 pain with numbers. ONE feature fix. CTA: 15 min this Thursday? Under 120 words.

TOUCH 2 DAY 3 CASE STUDY: Assume no reply. Share specific case: 'A 4-vet equine practice in Texas saved 10 hrs/week' or 'An imaging center in FL cut callbacks 60% in 90 days.' Real practice type, location, before/after numbers. CTA: Want to see how? Under 100 words.

TOUCH 3 DAY 7 ANGLE SHIFT: Different feature than Touch 1. If T1=speed then T3=teleconsult or AI. If T1=offline then T3=billing or voice-to-text. Provocative question. CTA: 10-min demo? Under 100 words.

TOUCH 4 DAY 14 BREAK-UP: Signal finality. Respect their time. One punchy line about what they miss. CTA: If timing is ever right Im here. Under 80 words.

=== RULES ===
1. Subjects: punchy, max 8 words, curiosity-driven. Examples: 'Your PACS costs you $30K/year' or 'Still typing barn notes at 9pm?'
2. FORBIDDEN: synergy leverage innovative cutting-edge solution partnership opportunity streamline efficient robust
3. NEVER SAY: Id love to, I wanted to reach out, I hope this finds you well
4. Use NUMBERS and SPECIFICS in every touch
5. Sign off: Deepak Raj, GTM Engineer, Asteris
6. Each touch = different angle. Never repeat pain points or features.
7. LinkedIn message: 2 sentences. Reference ONE thing. Ask ONE question.

Return ONLY valid JSON:
{"touch_1":{"subject":"","body":"","day":1},"touch_2":{"subject":"","body":"","day":3},"touch_3":{"subject":"","body":"","day":7},"touch_4":{"subject":"","body":"","day":14},"linkedin_message":"","personalization_notes":"","confidence":""}

